---
// The KM tab icon. Every page includes this so the icon never differs between pages.
// The .ico is a fallback for browsers/tools without SVG favicon support; sizes="32x32"
// keeps Chrome from preferring it over the SVG.
// Bump the ?v= value after changing either file so browsers drop their cached copy.
---

<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=2.1" sizes="32x32" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg?v=2.1" />
